<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <%- include('partials/seo-head') %>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <%- themeCSS %>
  <style>
    /* ---- HVAC PAGE ---- */
    .hvac-page { min-height: 100vh; background: var(--bg); }

    .hvac-nav {
      padding: 20px 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }
    .nav-brand {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--fg);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 100px;
    }
    .nav-dropdown-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--fg);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-dropdown-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-dim); }
    .nav-dropdown-menu {
      display: none;
      position: absolute;
      top: calc(100% + 8px);
      right: 0;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 12px;
      min-width: 220px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      z-index: 200;
    }
    .nav-dropdown-menu.open { display: block; }
    .nav-dropdown-item {
      display: block;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.15s, background 0.15s;
    }
    .nav-dropdown-item:hover { color: var(--fg); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
    .nav-dropdown-item--active { color: var(--accent); }

    /* HERO */
    .hvac-hero {
      padding: 90px 24px 80px;
      background: linear-gradient(170deg, var(--bg) 0%, #0d1117 50%, var(--bg-subtle) 100%);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hvac-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -200px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 700px;
      height: 700px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,232,123,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hvac-hero-inner {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
    }
    .hvac-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      padding: 6px 18px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .hvac-hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 3.8rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .hvac-hero h1 .accent { color: var(--accent); }
    .hvac-hero-sub {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .hvac-proof {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 36px;
    }
    .proof-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .proof-num {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    .proof-label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    }

    /* CALCULATOR */
    .calc-section {
      padding: 100px 24px;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
    }
    .calc-inner {
      max-width: var(--max-w);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .calc-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .calc-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .calc-header p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
    }
    .calc-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .calc-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .calc-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .calc-field { margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .calc-field label {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--fg);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .calc-field input {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--fg);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
      appearance: none;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .calc-field input:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-dim);
    }
    .calc-field .hint {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .calc-range {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .calc-range span { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--fg-muted); }
    .calc-result-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, rgba(0,232,123,0.07) 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-glow);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
    }
    .result-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .result-header h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .result-big {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.6rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--danger);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .result-period {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .result-divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .result-annual {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .result-annual-label {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .result-annual-val {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    .result-annual-sub {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .result-assumptions {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .result-assumptions strong { color: var(--fg); }

    /* ASSUMPTION BAR */
    .assumptions-bar {
      max-width: var(--max-w);
      margin: 24px auto 0;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 40px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .assumption-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .assumption-val {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--fg);
    }
    .assumption-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
    }

    /* TIERS */
    .tiers-section {
      padding: 100px 24px;
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    .tiers-inner {
      max-width: var(--max-w);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .tiers-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .tiers-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .tiers-header p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
    }
    .packages-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .package-card--smb {
      border-color: var(--accent-glow);
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, rgba(0,232,123,0.06) 100%);
    }
    .package-badge--smb {
      position: absolute;
      top: -12px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #0a0a0f;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 4px 14px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .package-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
      position: relative;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .package-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
    .package-card--featured {
      border-color: var(--accent-glow);
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, rgba(0,232,123,0.05) 100%);
    }
    .package-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -12px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #0a0a0f;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 4px 14px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .package-tier {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
    }
    .package-price {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--fg);
    }
    .package-price-sub {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
    }
    .package-monthly {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: -6px;
    }
    .package-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .package-features {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .package-features li {
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      line-height: 1.4;
      padding-left: 20px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .package-features li::before {
      content: '✓';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
    .package-cta {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-top: 4px;
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }
    .package-cta:hover { opacity: 0.85; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .package-cta--primary { background: var(--accent); color: #0a0a0f; }
    .package-cta--outline { background: transparent; color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid var(--accent-glow); }

    /* CTA SECTION */
    .cta-section {
      padding: 120px 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, #0d1117 100%);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cta-section::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 80px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.3;
    }
    .cta-inner {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
    }
    .cta-section h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .cta-section p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .cta-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .cta-note {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
    }
    .cta-trust {
      margin-top: 32px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .trust-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
    }
    .trust-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    /* ---- TRUST BAR ---- */
    .hvac-trust-bar {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .hvac-trust-item {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 18px 16px;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--fg-muted);
    }
    .hvac-trust-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .hvac-trust-icon { font-size: 1rem; }

    /* ---- TESTIMONIALS ---- */
    .testimonials-section {
      padding: 100px 24px;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
    }
    .testimonials-inner {
      max-width: var(--max-w);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .testimonials-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }
    .testimonials-label {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .testimonials-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .testimonials-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .testimonial-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      transition: border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .testimonial-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(0,232,123,0.2);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
    .testimonial-quote {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--fg);
      font-style: normal;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .testimonial-quote::before {
      content: '\u201C';
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      opacity: 0.4;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .testimonial-attr {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }
    .testimonial-name {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--fg);
    }
    .testimonial-sep { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .testimonial-role { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--fg-muted); }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .packages-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hvac-hero { padding: 72px 20px 60px; }
      .hvac-proof { gap: 20px; }
      .calc-section, .tiers-section, .testimonials-section { padding: 72px 20px; }
      .calc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .calc-card, .calc-result-card { padding: 28px 20px; }
      .packages-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta-section { padding: 80px 20px; }
      .assumptions-bar { gap: 20px; }
      .cta-trust { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
      .hvac-trust-bar { flex-direction: column; }
      .hvac-trust-item { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
      .hvac-trust-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hvac-page">

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav class="hvac-nav">
    <a href="/" class="nav-brand">Autovyne</a>
    <div class="nav-industries" style="position:relative;">
      <button class="nav-dropdown-btn" onclick="toggleDropdown(this)">Industries ▾</button>
      <div class="nav-dropdown-menu">
        <a href="/hair-and-beauty" class="nav-dropdown-item">Hair &amp; Beauty</a>
        <a href="/contractors" class="nav-dropdown-item">Contractors</a>
        <a href="/towing-and-automotive" class="nav-dropdown-item">Towing &amp; Automotive</a>
        <a href="/restaurants-and-hospitality" class="nav-dropdown-item">Restaurants &amp; Hospitality</a>
        <a href="/medical-and-dental" class="nav-dropdown-item">Medical &amp; Dental</a>
        <a href="/hvac" class="nav-dropdown-item nav-dropdown-item--active">HVAC</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hvac-hero">
    <div class="hvac-hero-inner">
      <div class="hvac-badge">For HVAC &amp; Home Service Businesses</div>
      <h1>HVAC Companies: Stop Losing <span class="accent">$7K/Month</span> to Missed Calls</h1>
      <p class="hvac-hero-sub">Every missed call is a lost job worth $300–$2,500. Autovyne's AI automation captures every lead, responds instantly, and books appointments — even at 2am.</p>
      <div class="hvac-proof">
        <div class="proof-item">
          <span class="proof-num">67%</span>
          <span class="proof-label">of callers choose the first company that answers</span>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-item">
          <span class="proof-num">35%</span>
          <span class="proof-label">of HVAC calls go to voicemail — permanently lost</span>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-item">
          <span class="proof-num">$8,400</span>
          <span class="proof-label">avg annual revenue lost by a single-missed call</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROI CALCULATOR -->
  <section class="calc-section">
    <div class="calc-inner">
      <div class="calc-header">
        <h2>Calculate Your Revenue at Risk</h2>
        <p>Enter your actual numbers. We'll show you what missed calls are costing you.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-grid">
        <!-- INPUT CARD -->
        <div class="calc-card">
          <h3>Your Numbers</h3>
          <div class="calc-field">
            <label>Missed calls per week</label>
            <input type="number" id="calc-missed" value="12" min="1" max="500">
            <div class="calc-range"><span>1</span><span>500</span></div>
            <p class="hint">How many calls go unanswered or to voicemail?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-field">
